<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17110" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">expressĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		exprimo (postAug.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a pressing</i> or <i>squeezing
				out.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mellis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Jun. 7, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spiritus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9,
					9</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In mechanics,
				<i>a forcing apparatus</i> to raise water, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 7</span></i>; cf. 2.
			expressus.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			In architect., <i>a projection</i>, i. e. <i>a fillet</i>, <i>listel</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 4, 4 <i>fin.</i></span></i> —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b> Of lang., <i>vividness</i>: summā expressione describere, Ambros. de
			Cain et Abel, 1, 2, 9. </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
